They will not move your money.

11
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:42,560
The usual answer is to push accuracy
higher.

12
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:45,440
Accuracy is an asymptote.

13
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:48,740
So this is not a check that can fail.

14
00:00:48,740 --> 00:00:51,020
It is a capability.

15
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:57,340
The code that moves money accepts only an
execute credential, and that credential

16
